Short:    DirDownloader Utility for FAME V0.2p
Uploader: siegel@deadline.snafu.de (Sascha Pfalz)
Author:   siegel@deadline.snafu.de (Sascha Pfalz)
Type:     bbs/misc

DirDownloader is the really first FAME Tool to download the filelistings. It
supports LHA, LZX and ZIP and has also an integrated Configuration program.
AmigaGuide documentation and Installerscript also included. 

DirDownloader requires at least FAME V1.4 or higher to run and runs therefor
only under Kickstart V37 or higher.
